    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:sourceText>| `rest` | Duration in [1,5] s | 0; none | Stay in place; regain stamina at `rest_rate` per second up to 100 throughout the interval. No automatic life healing. Biological clocks continue. |</zg:sourceText>
  </rdf:Description>
