  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_spit">
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">8.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:target_kind>Agent</zg:target_kind>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">8.0</zg:cooldown>
    <rdfs:label>spit</rdfs:label>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_spit"/>
    <zg:reach rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">12.0</zg:reach>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:PhysicalDamageEffect"/>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:InfectionOnsetEffect"/>
    <zg:sourceText>| `spit` | Living opponent directly visible within `spit_range` (12 m). Duration 1 s; 8 stamina; reserve 1 spit charge; cooldown 8 s. At a valid resolution, spend the charge and draw the zombie hit probability. On hit, deal `spit_damage` (4) physical damage; if the target remains a HEALTHY Human, attempt infection with potency `spit_potency` (0.30). Misses also spend the charge. Target-invalid attempts release it. Recharge follows Section 7.3. No persistent puddle or separate projectile entity is created. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_min>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:REJECTED">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionResult"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_open_gate">
    <zg:sourceText>| `open_gate` | CLOSED gate within 2 m | 1 s | 1 / none | Set mode OPEN, retain integrity. No automatic closing. An intact overlapping barricade still blocks passage. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:target_kind>Environment</zg:target_kind>
    <rdfs:label>open_gate</rdfs:label>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:GateOpeningEffect"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_open_gate"/>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_min>
    <zg:reach rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:reach>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0</zg:cooldown>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_move">
    <zg:target_kind>Path</zg:target_kind>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">5.0</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0</zg:cooldown>
    <rdfs:label>move</rdfs:label>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_move"/>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:MovementEffect"/>
    <zg:sourceText>| `move` | Planned continuous path beginning at current position; duration `dt` in [0.25,5] s | Actual path length × movement_cost; no cooldown | Path remains traversable, and speed at every point is &lt;= current `speed`. A zero-length path is legal but `wait` is the clearer choice. Follow the path without teleportation. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.25</zg:duration_min>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:WarriorState">
