  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_guard">
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:GuardEffect"/>
    <rdfs:label>guard</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">8.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_min>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">8.0</zg:cooldown>
    <zg:sourceText>| `guard` | Self. Duration 1 s; 8 stamina; cooldown 8 s. At completion apply physical resistance at least `guard_resistance` (0.60) for `guard_duration` (4 s). The Warrior can act again while this effect persists. Does not shield a different agent, prevent infection, or make a physical obstacle. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_guard"/>
    <zg:target_kind>SelfOrBroadcast</zg:target_kind>
  </rdf:Description>
