  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_mark_target">
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.5</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_mark_target"/>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.5</zg:duration_min>
    <zg:sourceText>| `mark_target` | A directly visible living agent. Duration 0.5 s; 1 stamina; cooldown 3 s. At completion, the target must still be visible. Emit a radius `mark_radius` (90 m), TTL 10 s signal containing target ID, type, position, and observation time. Allied receivers get a report; opponents get a noise cue. A mark does not track the target after emission or grant direct attack eligibility. |</zg:sourceText>
    <rdfs:label>mark_target</rdfs:label>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:CommunicationEffect"/>
    <zg:target_kind>Agent</zg:target_kind>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">3.0</zg:cooldown>
  </rdf:Description>
