  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_close_gate">
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:GateClosingEffect"/>
    <rdfs:label>close_gate</rdfs:label>
    <zg:sourceText>| `close_gate` | OPEN gate within 2 m | 1 s | 1 / none | Set mode CLOSED only if its footprint has no living agent and no intact overlapping barricade. Retain integrity. Cannot close a BREACHED gate. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_min>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_close_gate"/>
    <zg:reach rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:reach>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:duration_max>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.0</zg:cooldown>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:target_kind>Environment</zg:target_kind>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_signal">
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:cooldown>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:CommunicationEffect"/>
    <zg:target_kind>SelfOrBroadcast</zg:target_kind>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_signal"/>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.5</zg:duration_min>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">0.5</zg:duration_max>
    <rdfs:label>signal</rdfs:label>
    <zg:sourceText>| `signal` | Kind `WARNING`, `REQUEST_HELP`, `RESOURCE_REPORT`, or `DIRECTION`; payload consisting of an optional known entity ID, known/observed coordinate, and optional resource type/quantity; duration 0.5 s | 1 stamina; 2 s cooldown | At completion emit a signal at the actor's then-current location, radius 40 m, TTL 8 s. Payload must refer to information present in the actor's observation or memory, with its original observation time attached. No effect forces recipients to follow it. |</zg:sourceText>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
  </rdf:Description>
