    <zg:sourceText>| `demolish` | CLOSED gate or intact barricade within 2 m. Duration 3 s; 18 stamina; cooldown 6 s. Deal `demolish_damage` (60) integrity damage; apply the same breach/destruction rules as smash. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">3.0</zg:duration_min>
