    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:BarrierRepairEffect"/>
    <zg:sourceText>| `repair_barrier` | Damaged gate or intact damaged barricade within 2 m. Duration 5 s; 8 stamina; `repair_material_cost` (1 material); cooldown 1 s. Restore `repair_amount` (60) integrity up to its maximum. A breached gate becomes OPEN. Gate restoration must satisfy occupancy/barricade checks. A destroyed barricade cannot be repaired. Permanent walls cannot be repaired or strengthened. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">5.0</zg:duration_min>
    <rdfs:label>repair_barrier</rdfs:label>
