    <zg:reach rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:reach>
    <zg:sourceText>| `smash` | CLOSED gate or intact barricade within 2 m | 2 s | 10 / 1 s | Deal 20 integrity damage. At gate integrity 0, set BREACHED; at barricade integrity 0, remove its blocking effect. Permanent obstacles/walls are ineligible. |</zg:sourceText>
