  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_build_barricade">
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">8.0</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_build_barricade"/>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">12.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <zg:target_kind>Footprint</zg:target_kind>
    <zg:sourceText>| `build_barricade` | Specify center, orientation parallel to x or y, and length in [2,8] m; thickness is 1 m. Duration 8 s; 12 stamina; `build_material_cost` (2 materials); cooldown 2 s. Center must be within 2 m of the actor and the entire footprint visible and inside the world. At admission and completion its interior must not overlap any intact barrier other than an OPEN/BREACHED gate; shared edges with walls are allowed. Its closed footprint must contain no living agent, nonempty stockpile point, or nonexhausted remains point. Create a new barricade with integrity/max_integrity `build_integrity` (100). Footprints crossing a gate must satisfy Section 3.2. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ConstructionEffect"/>
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:cooldown>
    <zg:reach rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:reach>
    <rdfs:label>build_barricade</rdfs:label>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">8.0</zg:duration_min>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:Observation">
    <rdfs:label>Observation</rdfs:label>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
  </rdf:Description>
