  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:action_treat_infection">
    <zg:cooldown rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">2.0</zg:cooldown>
    <zg:mayCause rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:InfectionCureEffect"/>
    <zg:reach rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">1.5</zg:reach>
    <rdfs:label>treat_infection</rdfs:label>
    <zg:target_kind>Agent</zg:target_kind>
    <zg:duration_min rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">4.0</zg:duration_min>
    <zg:duration_max rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">4.0</zg:duration_max>
    <zg:coverage>PARTIAL: typed baseline parameters and shared checks; full behavioral coverage is listed in coverage.json.</zg:coverage>
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:ActionDefinition"/>
    <zg:stamina_cost rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">6.0</zg:stamina_cost>
    <zg:sourceText>| `treat_infection` | Target self or INFECTED living human within 1.5 m. Duration `treatment_duration` (4 s); 6 stamina; reserve/consume `treatment_cost` (1 medical supply); cooldown 2 s. Completion must be strictly before the target's conversion deadline. Close the active episode as CURED and set HEALTHY. Do not change life, hunger, stamina, or role. If the target converts, dies, or is cured first, release the item and fail/cancel as applicable. |</zg:sourceText>
    <zg:capability rdf:resource="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:cap_treat_infection"/>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="urn:zombie-game:v0.1:hasEnvironmentState">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"/>
  </rdf:Description>
